    "innovation": "This paper presents the first comprehensive global meta-analysis of marine ecological observations, showing that 81-83% of responses in distribution, phenology, and other traits are consistent with the expected impacts of climate change, with species shifting distributions and advancing phenology at rates comparable to or exceeding terrestrial systems.",
