            "paragraph": "Expected distributional and phenology shifts over 1960\u20132009 calculated using the Hadley Centre data set (HadISST 1.1) and methods presented in ref. 8. April temperatures used for Northern Hemisphere spring phenology and October temperatures for Southern Hemisphere phenology.",
